:''Not to be confused with the stage [[Wicked Tank]], its Cat counterpart [[Brainwashed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Tank Cat]], or [[Malevolent Eraser Cat]].''
'''Wicked Tank Cat''' (邪悪なネコ ''Jaakuna Tanku Neko'', '''Wicked Tank Cat''') is a [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]]-turned-[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]. It is introduced in the [[Wicked Tank]] event, which is unlocked after clearing [[Servant of Darkness]]. Although [[Brainwashed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Tank Cat]] is visually an allied counterpart of Wicked Tank Cat, it is not obtained by defeating this enemy, but rather from [[:Category:Seasonal Gacha Events|seasonal]] [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] events. It was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].

